.trabelsi@atlas.example\", \"id\": \"EM-2001\", \"subject\": \"Invoice INV-4471 dispute with Lumen Supplies\", \"to\": \"amira.bensalah@atlas.example\"}\n[tool_result] {\"body\": \"Purchase order PO-7782. Vendor: Lumen Supplies. Item: LED panel kits. Quantity authorized: 32 units. Unit price: 460 TND. Total authorized: 14,720 TND. Approved by: Karim Trabelsi.\", \"id\": \"DOC-3101\", \"title\": \"PO-7782 purchase order (Lumen Supplies)\"}"}], "response_content": "{\"type\": \"tool_call\", \"tool\": \"email_draft\", \"arguments\": {\"to\": \"billing@lumen-supplies.example\", \"subject\": \"Re: Invoice INV-4471 dispute with Lumen Supplies\", \"body\": \"Dear Billing Team,\\n\\nWe are writing to clarify the invoice INV-4471 for Lumen Supplies. According to our purchase order PO-7782, we authorized only 32 units at 460 TND per unit, totaling 14,720 TND. However, the invoice is for 40 units, which amounts to 18,400 TND. The disputed difference is 3,680 TND.\\n\\nPlease find the purchase order (DOC-3101) and the delivery note (DOC-3102) for reference. We kindly request a resolution to this discrepancy.\\n\\nThank you for your attention to this matter.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nAmira Bensalah\"}}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 216, "prompt_tokens": 1200, "total_tokens": 1416, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1092}}, "synthetic_data_only": true}
